    "type": "Figure",
    "diagnosis": "Tubular adenoma with high-grade dysplasia",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "An area of high-grade dysplasia with more-complex cribriform architecture, including foci of near-solidity, composed of cells with nuclear enlargement and marked nuclear pleomorphism seen on low-power view.",
    "source": "<p>Sigurd Lax</p>",
